{{Infobox Hazard
| title=Ice Plant
| image=Ice Plant.png
| description=When stepped on by a creature or otherwise damaged, it explodes into a temporary stasis cloud which also deals mild damage. Note that only Helldivers get slowed, other creatures are stunned while in the slowing field.
| type=Flora
| locations=Arctic Biomes}}

'''Frost Flower''', is a teal colored flower with bio-luminescent elements. It is considered an [[Environmental Hazards|Environmental Hazard]].

== Effect ==
When stepped on by a creature or otherwise damaged, it explodes into a temporary stasis cloud which slows and deals mild damage to [[Helldiver]]s. Other creatures are stunned while in the slowing field.

== Detailed Statistics ==
{{Attack_Data/attack|explosion|Iceplant_Shatter}}

== Locations ==
They can be found on Arctic [[Biomes]], such as [[Icy Glaciers]] and the [[Boneyard]].

== Change History ==
{{Change History Head}}
{{Change History Update|1.007.100|changes=
Fix
* Fixed issue that caused Ice Plant hazard, found on arctic planets, to ragdoll and stagger more than intended.
}}
{{Change History Update|1.006.300|changes=
Undocumented Change
* Stagger Force increased from 15 to 25. As a result, Helldivers can now be ragdolled.
}}

