Sandstorms.text:
{{Breadcrumb Auto|parent=Environmental Conditions|overview=Conditions}}
{{Environmental Conditions|Sandstorms}}
== Details ==
* Reduces visibility
** Things past 5m are more difficult to see
** Things past 25m are not visible
*[[Stealth#Enemy Behavior|Detection]]-ranges of enemies and Stratagem targeting-range are also reduced approximately by ~60-percent (E.G. [[AX/LAS-5 "Guard Dog" Rover]] targeting range is reduced from 30-meters to 12-meters during the storm)
*Lock-on ranges for guided weapons such as the [[FAF-14 Spear]] or [[P-92 Warrant]] are unaffected by weather conditions.
* Slows down Helldivers, both normal walking and sprinting. Does not affect sprint duration.
* Functionally identical with [[Blizzards]]

== Affected Biomes ==
* [[Desert Dunes]]

== Change History ==
{{Change History Head}}
{{Change History Update|1.001.002|changes=
Changes
* Sandstorms are now blocked by energy shields such as the [[SH-32 Shield Generator Pack|Shield Generator Pack]] and [[FX-12 Shield Generator Relay|Shield Generator Relay]].
}}
{{Change History Update|1.000.200|changes=
* Added to the game.
}}

