Extreme Cold.text:
{{Breadcrumb Auto|parent=Environmental Conditions|overview=Conditions}}
{{Quote|Icy temperatures reduce rate of fire and delay heat buildup in weapons.|Galactic War Map}}

{{Environmental Conditions|Extreme Cold}}


==Effects==
Extreme Cold is applied depending on the time of day and weather conditions.  On certain planets, it's always active.

* Rate of fire is reduced by about 10%.
* Heat-based weapons lose heat faster, contrary to the in-game description stating that it delays heat buildup. This means that once overheated, it takes a shorter amount of time for the weapon to cool down, usually by a factor of 33% relative to its normal cooldown duration.<ref>[https://youtu.be/okeILhqZc4o Helldivers 2 - Laser Cooldowns Tested on Hot vs Cold Planets]</ref>

== Affected Biomes ==
*[[Boneyard]]
*[[Icy Glaciers]]
*[[Moon]]
*[[Desert Dunes]]

== Change History ==
{{Change History Head}}
{{Change History Update|1.001.100|changes=
Changes
* The Extreme Cold modifier is no longer static throughout the entire mission, and may now change based on time of day or different weather conditions.
* [[Desert Dunes|Some desert planets]] may now have the Extreme Cold modifier at night.
}}

== References ==
<references />

